Common AddressCharacteristic
    documentation "Reflects important characteristics of an Address. If Address has a characteristic present, that characteristic is considered true or active for that Address. If a characteristic is not present, no assumption is made as to the applicability of the characteristic, but local policy may dictate otherwise."
    descriptor AddressCharacteristic
        documentation "The characteristic designated for the Address."
        is part of identity
    common Period
        documentation "The time periods for which characteristic was effective."
        is optional collection
    shared string DesignatedBy
        documentation "The person, organization, or department that designated the characteristic."
        is optional
